# 📊 Statistical Distribution Analysis of Transaction Data

> **Course Assignment** — Statistical Distributions, Probability Modelling & Data Analysis  
> **Dataset**: Financial Transaction Records | **Tools**: Python, NumPy, Pandas, SciPy, Statsmodels, Matplotlib, Seaborn

---

## 📌 Project Overview

This project performs an end-to-end **statistical distribution analysis** on a real-world financial transaction dataset containing **220 records** across January 2023. The goal is to understand the probabilistic nature of transaction behaviour and model it using multiple statistical distributions.

